        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://alexandercountync.gov/explore/",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The county was founded in 1847, the same year the first land sale occurred in its seat, Taylorsville.",
